DGX Chat
=======

DGX Chat is a self-hosted, multi-device chat front end built on top of the
open-source project deepseek-ai/chat-demo.

  Upstream: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/chat-demo
  License:  MIT (see LICENSE)

The upstream copyright notice and the MIT license are retained verbatim in
LICENSE. Modifications in this repository include: a runtime-configurable API
origin, account login/registration, cloud session synchronisation, and
DGX Chat branding.
